g each girl to life with every breath.<br><br>-Make memories. Every few shifts the girls will get more crazier than usual and let their freak flag fly with unlockable images. Collect them all!<br>-Be a perfectionist. Use your talents to make every drink and get achievements for each shift!<br><br>-Over 100 frames of animation and over 20 CG's by PixelboyMagazin!\u200b<br><br>-Amazing music by Shady Lewd Kart composer Altered Ego!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630420/extras/1837ad290ba3dd82c3cd65dd43e505f7.avif?t=1746611208\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630420/extras/7b751d3a389c16fc04a6d2c27e1491d4.avif?t=1746611208\" /></div><br>-All characters in game are 18+",
