    "reviews": "\u201cWhat helps this game work isn\u2019t the gameplay, or even the very adult dialogue or sexual scenes you\u2019ll  unlock as you play, which reveal far more than I\u2019ve seen on the Nintendo Switch so far, but that of its  unique personality.\u201d<br>Jeff Young<br><br>\u201c\u201cSlime Girl Smoothies is an engaging, sometimes sexy puzzle excursion from eastasiasoft. While I was  initially perplexed to discover it\u2019s not a match-3, I grew to enjoy the puzzle mechanics. It features an  eclectic group of rather horny slime girls to interact with, and a few modes to keep things fresh.\u201d<br>Josh Speer<br>",
